= The water cycle

Water moves between the sea, the air and the land in a cycle that never stops. The sun's heat drives it.

#figure(kind: image, caption: [The water cycle.])[
  ```mermaid
  flowchart LR
    A[Ocean] -->|Evaporation| B[Water vapour]
    B -->|Condensation| C[Clouds]
    C -->|Precipitation| D[Rain and snow]
    D -->|Runoff| A
    D -->|Infiltration| E[Groundwater]
    E --> A
  ```
]

